#
# Slackware AArch64 Linux build process for HailoRT software on the 
# Hailo-10H AI Accelerator Module installed on a Raspberry Pi 5.
#
# hailo-10h.SlackBuild 
# 2026-04-22 - v0.0.1 - Progenitor
# 2026-05-11 - v1.0.5 - Updated for public release
#
